some-nonfn: THROW TypeError: predicate is not callable
every-nonfn: THROW TypeError: predicate is not callable
reduce-nonfn: THROW TypeError: Array.prototype.reduce callback is not callable
flatMap-nonfn: THROW TypeError: Array.prototype.flatMap mapper is not callable
from-nonfn: THROW TypeError: Array.from: mapFn is not callable
new-Array-neg: THROW RangeError: Invalid array length
new-Array-frac: THROW RangeError: Invalid array length
set-length: THROW RangeError: Invalid array length
set-length-frac: THROW RangeError: Invalid array length
Array-ctor: 3 | ["3"] | [1, 2] | [] | []
